# Enterprise Compliance Baseline — <%= projectName %>

> **Origin:** Structural skeleton ported from reference-impl/docs/SYSTEM/ENTERPRISE_COMPLIANCE.md (M-03, #711). The reference document is 6308 LOC; this template ports the **structure**, not the content. Fill in each section with project-specific evidence.

## How to use this baseline

1. This file is generated by `arbiter init` when `compliance.enterprise_baseline: true` is set in `arbiter.json` (see §Opt-in below).
2. Each section below has a marker `[FILL: ...]` indicating what your team must provide. Empty markers fail the L2 compliance gate.
3. Update this baseline whenever scope changes (new processing activity, new region, new third-party processor). Diffs are reviewed in the same PR as the change.

## Opt-in flag

```jsonc
{
  "compliance": {
    "enterprise_baseline": true,
  },
}
```

