## What this baseline does NOT include

- **Vendor lock-in advice.** Per never-import policy, this template avoids prescribing specific vendors (KMS, SIEM, etc.). Reference any-vendor patterns; pick your own.
- **Country-specific data residency rules.** The reference-impl is EU-centric. If your project ships in additional jurisdictions, extend §1.* with the additional regimes (CCPA, LGPD, etc.) — do not edit this file's structure, append new top-level sections.
- **Per-control implementation evidence.** Evidence belongs in `.evidence/compliance/` with SHA pins; this baseline is the index, not the artifact store.

